<div class="ed-reading guide-reading text-lg">
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">A high number on a performance screen can look alarming. Before acting on it, record what the computer was doing and whether the reading coincided with the problem you felt. A snapshot is an observation, not a verdict on the machine.</p>
<section class="ed-start" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><p class="ed-label">Start here</p><h2 id="start-heading">Connect the reading to a real task</h2><p>Record the task first, then the category, value and timing you observed.</p><div class="ed-choices">
